  "slides": [
    {
      "kind": "cover",
      "quote": {
        "text": "How do I stop a shop doing work I didn't authorize",
        "source": "searchedProblems[1].phrase"
      },
      "emphasis": [
        "authorize"
      ],
      "promise": {
        "text": "What to tell a mechanic before the work starts",
        "source": "guide:what-to-tell-a-mechanic-before-work-starts/title"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "answer",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "In short",
        "source": "micro"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Say what you are asking for, the most you will approve without a call, and ask for an estimate in writing.",
          "source": "guide:what-to-tell-a-mechanic-before-work-starts/dek#0"
        },
        {
          "text": "Scripts to say and a page to hand over.",
          "source": "guide:what-to-tell-a-mechanic-before-work-starts/dek#1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "The short version, in order",
        "source": "guide:what-to-tell-a-mechanic-before-work-starts/body[3].heading"
      },
      "number": {
        "text": "1",
        "source": "micro"
      },
      "head": {
        "text": "Say what you're asking for in specific terms.",
        "source": "guide:what-to-tell-a-mechanic-before-work-starts/body[3].items[0]#0"
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "\"An oil and filter change and a tire rotation\" is a request.",
          "source": "guide:what-to-tell-a-mechanic-before-work-starts/body[3].items[0]#1"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Have a look at it\" gives the shop room to decide what's needed.",
          "source": "guide:what-to-tell-a-mechanic-before-work-starts/body[3].items[0]#2"
        }
      ],
      "emphasis": [
        "specific"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "The short version, in order",
        "source": "guide:what-to-tell-a-mechanic-before-work-starts/body[3].heading"
      },
      "number": {
        "text": "2",
        "source": "micro"
      },
      "head": {
        "text": "Give a limit if you have one, and a number to reach you on during the day.",
        "source": "guide:what-to-tell-a-mechanic-before-work-starts/body[3].items[1]#0"
      },
      "body": [],
      "emphasis": [
        "during"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "The short version, in order",
        "source": "guide:what-to-tell-a-mechanic-before-work-starts/body[3].heading"
      },
      "number": {
        "text": "3",
        "source": "micro"
      },
      "head": {
        "text": "Ask what a diagnosis costs before it starts.",
        "source": "guide:what-to-tell-a-mechanic-before-work-starts/body[3].items[2]#0"
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "A shop can charge to find a problem, and whether that fee comes off the repair is worth knowing first.",
          "source": "guide:what-to-tell-a-mechanic-before-work-starts/body[3].items[2]#1"
        }
      ],
      "emphasis": [
        "diagnosis"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "The short version, in order",
        "source": "guide:what-to-tell-a-mechanic-before-work-starts/body[3].heading"
      },
      "number": {
        "text": "4",
        "source": "micro"
      },
      "head": {
        "text": "Ask that any further work be estimated in writing, by text or email if you can, so you have a record with a date.",
        "source": "guide:what-to-tell-a-mechanic-before-work-starts/body[3].items[3]#0"
      },
      "body": [],
      "emphasis": [
        "estimated"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "The short version, in order",
        "source": "guide:what-to-tell-a-mechanic-before-work-starts/body[3].heading"
      },
      "number": {
        "text": "5",
        "source": "micro"
      },
      "head": {
        "text": "Note the odometer reading and the date on your own copy, and take a photo of the dash.",
        "source": "guide:what-to-tell-a-mechanic-before-work-starts/body[3].items[4]#0"
      },
      "body": [],
      "emphasis": [
        "odometer"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "checklist",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "Before you hand over the keys",
        "source": "guide:what-to-tell-a-mechanic-before-work-starts/body[8].heading"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Say what you're asking for, and nothing more.",
          "source": "guide:what-to-tell-a-mechanic-before-work-starts/body[8].items[0]#0"
        },
        {
          "text": "Say the most you'll approve without a call.",
          "source": "guide:what-to-tell-a-mechanic-before-work-starts/body[8].items[1]#0"
        },
        {
          "text": "Get every extra in writing before you say yes.",
          "source": "guide:what-to-tell-a-mechanic-before-work-starts/body[8].items[2]#0"
        },
        {
          "text": "Keep the request, the estimate and the invoice together.",
          "source": "guide:what-to-tell-a-mechanic-before-work-starts/body[8].items[3]#0"
        }
      ],
      "ticks": true
    },
    {
      "kind": "help",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "How it helps",
        "source": "micro"
      },
      "name": {
        "text": "Vehicle Maintenance Companion",
        "source": "title"
      },
      "line": {
        "text": "Hand them a dated, mileage-stamped page saying what you are requesting today and that nothing else is authorized without a conversation first.",
        "source": "searchedProblems[1].answer"
      },
